  "summary": {
    "keyInsights": [
      "The ladder reaches 12 feet up the wall. Forms a 5-12-13 Pythagorean triple."
    ],
    "fullSolution": "Using $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$: $5^2 + b^2 = 13^2 \\Rightarrow 25 + b^2 = 169 \\Rightarrow b^2 = 144 \\Rightarrow b = 12$ feet",
